WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.200
[Soft piano music]

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.179
Maya: Two seats, front row. Told you we'd make it.

3
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.291
Theo: Barely. Westheimer was all brake lights.

4
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.659
Maya: So what's on tonight?

5
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.565
Theo: Whatever the host picks. That's half the fun.

6
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.824
Maya: No spoilers, then.

7
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.345
Theo: None. Just a good seat and good company.

8
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.950
[The house lights dim]

9
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.608
Maya: Here it comes.

10
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.779
Theo: Phones down. Sound on.

11
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.100
[The piano swells, then fades]
